  "story": {
    "day": 22,
    "title": "A Cold Saturday in Japan",
    "sentences": [
      "Last Saturday, Kaya went to the movie theater in Japan.",
      "First, she saw me and her friend, Tom.",
      "A woman sat on a purple chair near us.",
      "Tom said, \"Hi Kaya, you're early, so please meet Mr. Brown.\"",
      "Mr. Brown lived here from May to August.",
      "He drew a violet picture in his notebook.",
      "They talked about September, October, November, and December.",
      "\"We aren't cold at minus five,\" they said happily.",
      "Finally, Kaya asked you for a small favor."
    ]
  }
